  asks (`src/updates.ts`, electron-updater). On Windows and with the AppImage, Update downloads it,
  quits Moneo cleanly, installs it and starts Moneo again; data stays in the user folder, and a pending
  migration makes a `pre-upgrade` backup first. macOS (unsigned) and `.deb` installs open the release
  page to download instead. Draft and pre-releases are never offered. `npm run desktop:dist` writes
  the `latest*.yml` files the check reads; the release workflow uploads them with the installers.

## Releasing

Releases are made only from a `v*` tag; pull request runs keep their installers as workflow
artifacts for 7 days and never create a release.

1. Bump `desktop/package.json`'s version on `main` (the first release is `0.1.0` as is).
2. Tag and push: `git tag v0.1.0 && git push origin v0.1.0`.
3. The Desktop workflow builds every platform and drafts a release with the installers, `latest*.yml`,
   blockmaps and `SHA256SUMS.txt`.
4. Publish the draft on GitHub. Drafts are invisible to visitors, to the landing page's download
   button and to Settings → App updates; once published, all three offer it.

### Bank return certificate

Enable Banking returns to `https://localhost:3443`. On every start Moneo makes that certificate with the
import { spawn, spawnSync } from "node:child_process";
import { createReadStream, existsSync, readdirSync, readFileSync, rmSync } from "node:fs";
import http from "node:http";
import os from "node:os";
import path from "node:path";
import { alive, check, Desktop, importCsv, powershell, root, statement, summary, tempHome, transactionsText, until } from "./harness.mjs";

if (process.platform !== "win32") { console.error("The installer check is for Windows (NSIS)."); process.exit(1); }
const installers = path.join(os.tmpdir(), "moneo-shell-qa-isolated-installers");
const installer = version => path.join(installers, version, `Moneo-Setup-${version}-x64.exe`);
const defaultInstall = path.join(process.env.LOCALAPPDATA, "Programs", "moneo-desktop");

if (process.argv.includes("--build")) {
  for (const version of ["0.1.0", "0.1.1"]) {
    const env = { ...process.env, MONEO_DESKTOP_VERSION: version, MONEO_DESKTOP_RELEASE_DIR: path.join(installers, version), MONEO_DESKTOP_TEST_INSTALLER: "1" };
    const result = spawnSync(process.execPath, [path.join(root, "node_modules", "electron-builder", "cli.js"), "--projectDir", "desktop", "--config", "electron-builder.config.cjs", "--win", "nsis"], { cwd: root, env, stdio: ["ignore", "inherit", "inherit"] });
    if (result.status !== 0) { console.error(`building ${version} failed`); process.exit(1); }
  }
}
for (const version of ["0.1.0", "0.1.1"]) if (!existsSync(installer(version))) { console.error(`Missing ${installer(version)}; run with --build.`); process.exit(1); }

